{"seq":2,"slug":"sw-manifest-payment-logistics","title":"清单/支付/物流数据一窗申报","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/single-window-digital-customs-connect/digital-customs-channel/sw-manifest-payment-logistics","wordCount":2237,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"清单-支付-物流数据一窗申报\">清单/支付/物流数据一窗申报</h1><p>上一篇讲了通道的前置条件与监管方式的语义。这一篇处理组装环节的工程细节：<strong>三条来自不同主体的数据，如何在单一窗口这个「一次提交」的约束下被拼成一份可复用的申报事实对象</strong>。</p>\n<p>这里有一个比一般贸易复杂得多的约束。一般贸易的申报数据基本由报关行一家产生，一致性靠内部纪律。跨境电商的三段数据来自平台、支付机构、承运商三个在法律与组织上都独立的主体，它们各自持有自己的真相、各自有自己的幂等语义、各自的到达时间也不同。组装层必须在这种条件下产出一份自洽的申报。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-把三单组装成一次-事实快照\">核心概念：把三单组装成一次「事实快照」</h2><p>组装的正确产物不是「订单 + 支付 + 物流的拼接」，而是一份<strong>带时间戳的事实快照</strong>：它记录了「在某个时刻，系统观测到的这笔交易的全部已知事实」。这个区分很重要，因为三段数据的到达是异步的，任何时刻的组装结果都只是当时的最优近似。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组装策略</th>\n<th>触发时机</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>订单到达即申报</td>\n<td>最快</td>\n<td>履约时延最低</td>\n<td>支付/物流段可能缺失，比对必然失败</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>三段齐备即申报</td>\n<td>最稳</td>\n<td>比对通过率高</td>\n<td>任一段缺失就阻塞，需处理超时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>支付到达即申报</td>\n<td>折中</td>\n<td>覆盖多数正常流</td>\n<td>物流段可能滞后，需容差规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定时批组装</td>\n<td>可控</td>\n<td>便于错峰与限流</td>\n<td>履约时延增加，不适合时效敏感商品</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>选择哪种策略取决于业务对时效的要求与退款成本。工程上应把它实现为<strong>可配置的组装策略 + 明确的最长等待时间</strong>，而不是写死在流程里。最长等待时间是一个必须显式设定的参数：如果物流段在超时后仍未到达，系统应当做出选择——要么以「物流段待补」的形态申报（如果通道支持），要么挂起并通知，要么取消订单。沉默地永久等待是最差的选项。</p>\n<p>组装策略的选择空间还受一个前沿约束限制：政务侧对<strong>信息到达时机</strong>有独立要求，且正在向更早的方向收紧。欧盟的入境摘要报关单要求在货物抵达前提交完整数据，空运货物还需在装载前提交最小数据集，申报可由运营者自行提交或通过 IT 服务商提交（<a href=\"https://taxation-customs.ec.europa.eu/customs/customs-security/import-control-system-2_en\">European Commission, ICS2</a>）。这意味着「等三段齐备再申报」在部分辖区可能根本来不及——组装器必须以<strong>政务侧的最早提交截止时间</strong>为硬约束，倒推自己的最长等待时间，而不是按业务偏好随意设定。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;  participant P as 平台&#10;  participant AS as 组装器&#10;  participant PS as 支付机构&#10;  participant LG as 承运商&#10;  participant SW as 单一窗口&#10;  P-&gt;&gt;AS: 订单事实(含最长等待 T)&#10;  PS-&gt;&gt;AS: 支付事实&#10;  LG-&gt;&gt;AS: 物流事实&#10;  AS-&gt;&gt;AS: 检查三段齐备度 + 启动超时计时&#10;  alt 三段齐备&#10;    AS-&gt;&gt;AS: 一致性校验 + 生成事实快照 v1&#10;  else 超时仍未齐备&#10;    AS-&gt;&gt;AS: 按策略: 补段申报 / 挂起 / 取消&#10;  end&#10;  AS-&gt;&gt;SW: 提交清单(含快照版本)&#10;  SW--&gt;&gt;AS: 受理确认(申报号)&#10;  AS-&gt;&gt;AS: 冻结快照 v1 为申报依据\">sequenceDiagram\n  participant P as 平台\n  participant AS as 组装器\n  participant PS as 支付机构\n  participant LG as 承运商\n  participant SW as 单一窗口\n  P-&gt;&gt;AS: 订单事实(含最长等待 T)\n  PS-&gt;&gt;AS: 支付事实\n  LG-&gt;&gt;AS: 物流事实\n  AS-&gt;&gt;AS: 检查三段齐备度 + 启动超时计时\n  alt 三段齐备\n    AS-&gt;&gt;AS: 一致性校验 + 生成事实快照 v1\n  else 超时仍未齐备\n    AS-&gt;&gt;AS: 按策略: 补段申报 / 挂起 / 取消\n  end\n  AS-&gt;&gt;SW: 提交清单(含快照版本)\n  SW--&gt;&gt;AS: 受理确认(申报号)\n  AS-&gt;&gt;AS: 冻结快照 v1 为申报依据</pre><p>最后一步「冻结快照」是关键的架构动作：<strong>申报一旦提交，其依据的数据快照就必须冻结</strong>。之后再收到支付段或物流段的更新（例如物流段补充了真实重量），不能就地修改已提交的申报，而必须走更正流程或作为下一次申报的输入。这与 <a href=\"../single-window-model/customs-port-inspection-tax\">海关/口岸/检验/税费联办</a> 中「税费结果不可就地重算」是同一条原则：已提交给政务侧的事实必须可重现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"事实快照的建模与版本\">事实快照的建模与版本</h2><p>快照的建模需要同时满足三个要求：可重现（能重放出当时提交的内容）、可追溯（能查到每一段的来源）、可比较（能看出两个版本之间改了什么）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;snapshotId&quot;: &quot;SNAP-2026-000123-v1&quot;,&#10;  &quot;manifestId&quot;: &quot;MF-2026-000123&quot;,&#10;  &quot;frozenAt&quot;: &quot;2026-09-27T07:05:00Z&quot;,&#10;  &quot;completeness&quot;: { &quot;order&quot;: true, &quot;payment&quot;: true, &quot;logistics&quot;: true },&#10;  &quot;segmentVersions&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;order&quot;: &quot;platform-A:order-rev-1&quot;,&#10;    &quot;payment&quot;: &quot;psp-B:pay-rev-1&quot;,&#10;    &quot;logistics&quot;: &quot;carrier-C:wb-rev-1&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;tolerancesApplied&quot;: [&quot;coupon_offset_v2&quot;, &quot;merged_shipment_v1&quot;],&#10;  &quot;payloadDigest&quot;: &quot;sha256:7d41...&quot;,&#10;  &quot;submissionRef&quot;: &quot;SUB-2026-000123&quot;,&#10;  &quot;supersedes&quot;: null&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"snapshotId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SNAP-2026-000123-v1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"manifestId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"MF-2026-000123\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"frozenAt\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-27T07:05:00Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"completeness\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"order\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"payment\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"logistics\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"segmentVersions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"order\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"platform-A:order-rev-1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"payment\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"psp-B:pay-rev-1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"logistics\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"carrier-C:wb-rev-1\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"tolerancesApplied\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"coupon_offset_v2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"merged_shipment_v1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"payloadDigest\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sha256:7d41...\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"submissionRef\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SUB-2026-000123\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"supersedes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>segmentVersions</code> 让「哪一段变了」变成可判定的事实；<code>tolerancesApplied</code> 让事后争议时有据可查；<code>payloadDigest</code> 与 <a href=\"../sw-integration-api/sw-interface-auth-cert\">单一窗口接口与证书认证</a> 里的 MIC 是同一套思路——本地留存摘要，用于与政务侧回执中的摘要比对，构成一次提交的证据链。</p>\n<h3 id=\"为什么快照要独立于业务表\">为什么快照要独立于业务表</h3><p>一个常见的实现是把清单数据直接存在订单表上，申报时读订单表生成报文。这在三段齐备、一次申报、永不更正的理想场景下可行，但真实场景里订单会持续更新（用户改地址、退款、拆单），于是同一个订单在不同时刻生成的报文不同，事后无法重现。</p>\n<p>快照独立存储后，业务表可以自由演化，而申报依据保持冻结。这是「为政务对接建立独立账本」这一原则在组装层的体现，与 <a href=\"../sw-ops-governance/sw-data-consistency-reconcile\">申报数据一致性与对账</a> 中的对账对象是同一个。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三段数据的幂等与去重\">三段数据的幂等与去重</h2><p>三段数据来自三个独立系统，每一段都可能重复投递。组装器必须对每一段都做幂等处理，否则会出现同一笔交易被组装出多个快照、进而被多次申报的严重后果。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据段</th>\n<th>天然幂等键</th>\n<th>需要注意的陷阱</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>订单</td>\n<td>平台订单号</td>\n<td>同一订单可能因改单产生多个修订版本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>支付</td>\n<td>支付机构流水号</td>\n<td>同一订单可能有多笔支付（分次付款、部分退款）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>物流</td>\n<td>运单号 + 承运商</td>\n<td>一单多包裹时运单号会分裂为多个</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"订单修订与重复投递的区分\">订单修订与重复投递的区分</h3><p>第一行的陷阱值得展开：订单的「修订」与「重复投递」是两种不同的现象，前者应当产生新版本、后者应当被丢弃。区分它们的依据是版本号或更新时间，而不是内容比对——内容比对会误判「同一内容被重复推送」为幂等，也会把「内容恰好相同但确实是两次修订」误判为重复。</p>\n<h3 id=\"物流段的分裂与合并\">物流段的分裂与合并</h3><p>第三个陷阱与其他两个方向相反：物流段的运单号会<strong>分裂</strong>（一单多包裹发出时会拆成多个运单），而不同运单又可能<strong>合并</strong>（同一收货人的多个包裹合并配送）。组装器必须能表达「一个订单对应 N 个运单，这 N 个运单合计的重量与件数才是物流段的事实」。</p>\n<h3 id=\"支付段是集合而非单值\">支付段是集合而非单值</h3><p>第二个陷阱值得单独展开：分次付款意味着「支付段」是一个集合而不是一个值。组装器必须能处理「订单金额 480，分两笔支付 200 + 280」的情形，并在三单比对时用合计金额而不是单笔金额比较。把支付段建模为单值会在这种场景下直接产出错误的申报。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 组装器读取某一订单的最新一段事实：每段取最新修订，支付段取合计&#10;WITH latest_order AS (&#10;  SELECT DISTINCT ON (order_no) order_no, revision, amount, currency, consignee_hash&#10;    FROM order_fact WHERE order_no = :orderNo ORDER BY order_no, revision DESC&#10;),&#10;paid AS (&#10;  SELECT order_no, SUM(amount) AS paid_total, MIN(paid_at) AS first_paid_at&#10;    FROM payment_fact WHERE order_no = :orderNo AND status = &#39;SUCCESS&#39;&#10;   GROUP BY order_no&#10;),&#10;logi AS (&#10;  SELECT order_no, SUM(gross_weight_kg) AS gw, COUNT(*) AS pkg_count&#10;    FROM logistics_fact WHERE order_no = :orderNo AND status &lt;&gt; &#39;CANCELLED&#39;&#10;   GROUP BY order_no&#10;)&#10;SELECT o.order_no, o.amount AS order_amount, p.paid_total,&#10;       l.gw, l.pkg_count,&#10;       (p.paid_total IS NOT NULL AND l.gw IS NOT NULL) AS is_complete&#10;  FROM latest_order o&#10;  LEFT JOIN paid p ON p.order_no = o.order_no&#10;  LEFT JOIN logi l ON l.order_no = o.order_no;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 组装器读取某一订单的最新一段事实：每段取最新修订，支付段取合计</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> latest_order </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (order_no) order_no, revision, amount, currency, consignee_hash</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_fact </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_no </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :orderNo </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_no, revision </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">paid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_no, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> paid_total, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">MIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(paid_at) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> first_paid_at</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> payment_fact </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_no </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :orderNo </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'SUCCESS'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_no</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">logi </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_no, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(gross_weight_kg) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gw, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pkg_count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> logistics_fact </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_no </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :orderNo </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'CANCELLED'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_no</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_no</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_amount, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">paid_total</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">gw</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">pkg_count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">paid_total</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">gw</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> is_complete</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> latest_order o</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> paid p </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_no</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_no</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> logi l </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_no</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_no</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>DISTINCT ON</code> 取最新修订、支付段按订单聚合、物流段排除已取消运单，这三处各自对应一个真实陷阱。查询末尾的 <code>is_complete</code> 是组装决策的直接输入——它决定走哪条组装分支。</p>\n<h2 id=\"申报字段与三段数据的映射纪律\">申报字段与三段数据的映射纪律</h2><p>组装层最容易腐化的地方是「字段映射散落各处」。当某个字段来自哪一段、经过什么换算、适用什么容差没有被集中描述时，任何一次口径调整都会变成跨模块的排查。</p>\n<p>把映射做成<strong>声明式的一张表</strong>是对抗腐化的有效手段：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# manifest-field-map.yaml（示意：每行说明申报字段的来源与换算）&#10;manifestId: { from: generated, rule: &#39;uuidv7, prefix MF-&#39; }&#10;goodsAmount: { from: order.amount, rule: &#39;identity&#39; }&#10;paidAmount: { from: payment.paid_total, rule: &#39;identity&#39; }&#10;grossWeight: { from: logistics.gw, rule: &#39;sum_by_order&#39; }&#10;packageCount: { from: logistics.pkg_count, rule: &#39;sum_by_order&#39; }&#10;consigneeIdHash: { from: order.consignee_hash, rule: &#39;identity&#39; }&#10;commodityCode: { from: product_filing.commodity_code, rule: &#39;lookup_by_filing_no&#39; }&#10;qty: { from: order.lines.quantity, rule: &#39;sum_by_sku&#39; }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># manifest-field-map.yaml（示意：每行说明申报字段的来源与换算）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">manifestId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">generated</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">rule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'uuidv7, prefix MF-'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">goodsAmount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">order.amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">rule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'identity'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">paidAmount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">payment.paid_total</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">rule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'identity'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">grossWeight</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">logistics.gw</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">rule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'sum_by_order'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">packageCount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">logistics.pkg_count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">rule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'sum_by_order'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">consigneeIdHash</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">order.consignee_hash</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">rule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'identity'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">commodityCode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">product_filing.commodity_code</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">rule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'lookup_by_filing_no'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">qty</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">order.lines.quantity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">rule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'sum_by_sku'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这张表的价值在三处体现：新字段接入时改一处；口径变更时能看到影响面；生成报文时可以据此做「每个申报字段都有来源」的完备性检查——<strong>没有来源的字段就是硬编码，硬编码的申报字段在政务审计时无法解释</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>组装的产物是<strong>带时间戳的事实快照</strong>，不是三段数据的拼接；快照记录「某时刻观测到的全部已知事实」，是对异步到达的显式承认。</li>\n<li>组装策略与<strong>最长等待时间</strong>都应当是配置；超时后必须做出选择（补段申报 / 挂起 / 取消），永久等待是最差选项。</li>\n<li>申报提交后必须<strong>冻结快照</strong>；已提交给政务侧的事实要可重现，与税费结果不可就地重算是同一条原则。</li>\n<li>每一段用各自的天然幂等键去重，但要注意三类陷阱：订单的「修订」不等于「重复」、支付段是<strong>集合而非单值</strong>（分次付款）、物流段的运单号会因一单多包裹分裂。</li>\n<li>字段映射做成<strong>声明式表</strong>，可做「每个申报字段都有来源」的完备性检查；无来源的字段即硬编码，在政务审计中无法解释。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>下一篇：见 <a href=\"sw-receipt-callback-flow\">单一窗口回执与异常回调</a>，看清单申报的结论如何回来、异常如何分流。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"清单/支付/物流数据一窗申报","id":"清单-支付-物流数据一窗申报"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：把三单组装成一次「事实快照」","id":"核心概念-把三单组装成一次-事实快照"},{"level":2,"text":"事实快照的建模与版本","id":"事实快照的建模与版本"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么快照要独立于业务表","id":"为什么快照要独立于业务表"},{"level":2,"text":"三段数据的幂等与去重","id":"三段数据的幂等与去重"},{"level":3,"text":"订单修订与重复投递的区分","id":"订单修订与重复投递的区分"},{"level":3,"text":"物流段的分裂与合并","id":"物流段的分裂与合并"},{"level":3,"text":"支付段是集合而非单值","id":"支付段是集合而非单值"},{"level":2,"text":"申报字段与三段数据的映射纪律","id":"申报字段与三段数据的映射纪律"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"跨境电商专用清关通道对接","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/single-window-digital-customs-connect/digital-customs-channel/ecommerce-dedicated-channel"},"next":{"title":"单一窗口回执与异常回调","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/single-window-digital-customs-connect/digital-customs-channel/sw-receipt-callback-flow"}}